From: plurx contributors <noreply@plurx.invalid>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vo_gpu_next: preserve DV and HDR10 planar 10-bit filtering precision

Use the UNORM16 range for software DV BL/EL and limited BT.2020/PQ
planar 10-bit planes by staging code<<6
and declaring bits16/10/6. Preserve MPI storage, siting, negative-stride
orientation and hardware/P010/UINT paths. Callback-null owned pointers
are consumed or copied before return, including upload failure. Refuse
missing/failed required EL mapping with explicit partial-frame cleanup.

